src/staking/AbstractStakingStrategy.sol:convertToAssets:51|class=C21|High|An unprivileged holder calls the permissionless initiateWithdraw on its own expired-PT position, which sets _isWithdrawRequestPending(t_CurrentAccount) true and permanently steers every subsequent convertToAssets read for that account off the fair super.convertToAssets PT share price and onto the escrow-denominated getWithdrawRequestValue (sUSDe/USDe cooldown claim), letting the account borrow against the inflated escrow valuation (or, in the opposite direction, drop a third party's collateral onto the cheaper branch to liquidate it via _postLiquidation's tokenizeWithdrawRequest).|src/staking/AbstractStakingStrategy.sol
